---

This template is derived from the NTU Thesis LaTeX Template by Hsin-Hsiang
Peng (Hsins), which is also MIT licensed:

    https://github.com/Hsins/NTU-Thesis-LaTeX-Template

The MIT terms above cover the LaTeX source, the class file, the scripts, and
the documentation in this repository. They do not extend to material this
repository merely reproduces:

  - figures/seal.pdf and figures/seal-grayscale.pdf are the National Taiwan
    University seal, the property of the university.
  - front/verification-letter.pdf and front/verification-letter-doctor.pdf are
    official blank forms published by NTU's Office of Academic Affairs
    (教務處) at https://www.aca.ntu.edu.tw/w/aca/GAADForms.

Fonts are deliberately not bundled. The default font set uses TeX Gyre Termes
(GUST Font License) and AR PL KaitiM Big5 (Arphic Public License), both
supplied by TeX Live rather than by this repository. See fonts/README.md.
